<title>JAPAN: Nomura ask-only after entities suspend business.</title>
<headline>Nomura ask-only after entities suspend business.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nomura Securities Co Ltd were ask-only in early Thursday morning trade, depressed by news that the central and local governments were suspending business with the brokerage, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0027 GMT, the shares were ask-only at 1,420 yen, after closing at 1,480 yen on the previous day.</p>
</text>
